10. THE PROPRIETARY COMPONENTS

The proprietary module set includes, at a high level:

  - Enterprise server and extensions (datastrato-server, common-extension,
    core-extension, lineage-extension)
  - Enterprise authorization (authorization-jdbc-enterprise, SCIM)
  - Search and metrics services
  - Additional JDBC catalogs (Oracle, BigQuery, MaxCompute, SQL Server)
  - Secret-backend bundles (Vault, OpenBao, Transit)
  - Governed Iceberg table encryption and trusted metadata integrity
  - License-management components
  - Enterprise documentation, QA, and supporting scripts and configuration

This list describes the proprietary module set as of this release. Some
proprietary components are specified at file rather than module
granularity in the build configuration.
